    "audioStrategy": "Hybrid, and declared per source. Grand, Upright and Electric play bundled *recordings* (three separate licensed sample sets loaded from the bundle). Clav, Digital and Misc are modelled additive synthesis. The Organ and Synth engines are live *synthesis* with no sample content at all: organ registrations are rendered to looped buffers from harmonic partial tables, and synth notes are rendered sample-by-sample from the oscillator, filter, envelope and LFO generators. Reverb impulse responses are generated at runtime; no recorded IRs are bundled. Every source is declared below, and no generated buffer is described as a recording.",
